- If I play Swamp, I have 1R + 2B = 3 mana. I can also cast Slate Street Ruffian (2B).\n\
- Dance with Devils costs 3R — needs at least 2 Mountains.\n\
- Havoc Jester costs 4R — needs at least 2 Mountains.\n\
- Heartfire costs 1R.\n\
\n\
I should play Mountain to get closer to casting Dance with Devils on turn 4 (needs 3R+1 generic = 4 mana with 2 Mountains minimum). Playing Mountain now gives me 2M+1S = 3 lands, then Swamp next turn = 4 lands (2M, 2S) — that's enough for Dance with Devils (3R).\n\
\n\
Let me play Mountain and then cast Slate Street Ruffian.",
