4\",\"toughness\":\"4\"}],\"recent_chat\":[\"Grok4 Story: In a twist of defensive valor, the Freebooter clashes with the Chaos Rider, while the humble Newt ensnares the Ruffian in a fatal embrace! Devils may dance, but our heroes turn the tide, sacrificing for the greater saga\\u0026mdash;watch as chaos unravels!\",\"Grok4 Story: And now, with the Replicator joining the fray, our band of misfits prepares for the clash! The Freebooter, pick in hand, leads the charge\\u0026mdash;will the Jester\\u0026#39;s havoc turn the tide, or shall our epic swing in favor of the underdogs? The plot thickens!\"],\"stop_reason\":\"combat\"}",
